{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GAL","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"加拉太書","commonName":"加拉太書","title":"加拉太書","order":48,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"3f4e11570f14d42ca69f68d7b16d1f7c52398224c8856b5c69715a513e4ad1c0","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GAL/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":149},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["各人的重擔要互相擔當"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄們，若有人偶然被過犯所勝，你們屬靈的人就當用溫柔的心把他挽回過來；又當自己小心，恐怕也被引誘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你們各人的重擔要互相擔當，如此，就完全了基督的律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["人若無有，自己還以為有，就是自欺了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["各人應當察驗自己的行為；這樣，他所誇的就專在自己，不在別人了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因為各人必擔當自己的擔子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在道理上受教的，當把一切需用的供給施教的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["不要自欺，上帝是輕慢不得的。人種的是甚麼，收的也是甚麼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["順着情慾撒種的，必從情慾收敗壞；順着聖靈撒種的，必從聖靈收永生。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我們行善，不可喪志；若不灰心，到了時候就要收成。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以，有了機會就當向眾人行善，向信徒一家的人更當這樣。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警告和祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["請看我親手寫給你們的字是何等的大呢！"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["凡希圖外貌體面的人都勉強你們受割禮，無非是怕自己為基督的十字架受逼迫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他們那些受割禮的，連自己也不守律法；他們願意你們受割禮，不過要藉着你們的肉體誇口。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但我斷不以別的誇口，只誇我們主耶穌基督的十字架；因這十字架，就我而論，世界已經釘在十字架上；就世界而論，我已經釘在十字架上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["受割禮不受割禮都無關緊要，要緊的就是作新造的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["凡照此理而行的，願平安、憐憫加給他們，和上帝的以色列民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["從今以後，人都不要攪擾我，因為我身上帶着耶穌的印記。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["弟兄們，願我主耶穌基督的恩常在你們心裏。阿們！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GAL/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EPH/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GAL/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}